Forward Alliance — Mattermost deployment
========================================

This directory builds and runs a MODIFIED version of the Mattermost server.
Because that modified version is offered to users over a network, AGPL v3.0
section 13 applies, and the Corresponding Source is published. See
"Obtaining the Corresponding Source" below.

Nothing here is affiliated with or endorsed by Mattermost, Inc.


