The plugins communicate with the Mattermost server over its RPC plugin API as
separate processes. They are licensed under AGPL v3.0 here regardless of
whether that boundary would make them independent works.


Obtaining the Corresponding Source
----------------------------------

The Corresponding Source for the running server is the upstream tree at the
pinned MATTERMOST_SOURCE_REF, plus the patch scripts and Dockerfile in this
directory. Applying them to that revision reproduces the deployed binary.

  https://github.com/ForwardAlliance/fa-mattermost

Deployment configuration containing credentials is not part of the published
source. .env.prod.example lists every variable the deployment reads, with
placeholder values.


